WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:01.550
Shida Kuroha...

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:05.980
I love you!

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.090
A dream...

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.910
No, stop! Don't remember it!

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.210
Nothing happened!

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:15.430
Yeah! I'm going with that!

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.300
I need you!

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:20.240
Nope.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:24.170
Okay... I'll play gravure idol 
shiritori for a change of pace!

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.530
A... Anzai Maaya.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.140
Next is ya... ya...

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.120
No.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:34.700
Idiot! Idiot! I'm such an idiot!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.700
Did I think my chance of success 
was 100% as long as I beat Abe?!

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:43.240
Did I think there was no way Kuro 
would refuse?! Was I that cocky?!

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:48.680
Ugh! Stupid Haru! Stupid! Stupid!

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:50.620
It's all your fault, you know!

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:55.280
If you had accepted me when I confessed 
the first time, this wouldn't have...

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.850
I got him back <i>too</i> good.

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:02.450
I mean, at first, I thought 
about getting revenge...

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:07.440
But up until that moment, I planned 
to say yes if he confessed to me.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.710
I'm hopeless, aren't I?

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:11.960
What do I do?

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:17.170
But... I can't just lose.

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:23.420
Because I love him.

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:25.360
Su-chan...

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:28.310
You really did look amazing.

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:32.120
Su-chan...

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:33.680
Shiro...

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.110
I... <i>was</i> in love with you.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:39.340
<i>...was... was... was... was...</i>

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:45.210
Su-chan, you idiot!

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.120
I tried so hard!

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:50.790
I made you fall for me, just like 
I said... and yet... and yet...

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.050
Su-chan, you cheating jerk!

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:56.410
Why would you turn to another 
girl after saying you loved me?!

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:58.240
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.960
You're an idiot, Su-chan.

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:02.300
But I love you.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.920
I got shot down in front of everyone 
after putting on a show like that!

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:09.600
What do I do now?! How can I 
even show myself at school?!

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:13.940
If that loser wasn't around, 
this wouldn't have...

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:16.390
That's right. It's not Su-chan's fault.

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:18.240
It was all that little homewrecker!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:39.880
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:53.830
Mornin'.

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:54.780
Oh?

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:02.790
Well, after all that, 
I guess I can't blame you.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:08.350
<i>Maru Sueharu-kun of class 2-B,</i>

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.290
<i>please come to the faculty room.</i>

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:12.580
Huh? What for?

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.680
Damn, they picked up on that 
faster than I thought.

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:20.360
Uh, Tetsuhiko, you're giving me a 
really bad feeling right now.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:23.400
Hey, sorry. Are you already here?

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.200
Hey.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.560
Would you mind backing off just a bit?

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:28.910
Yeah. Yeah, that's great, thanks.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.980
Tetsuhiko, what was that?

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.400
Huh? A TV station.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.830
TV?! Why?

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:37.980
I uploaded a video from our 
cultural festival to WeTube,

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:40.090
and it got over a million 
views in three days.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:40.660
Huh?

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:41.540
This.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:46.260
<b>Legendary Child Actor</b>

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:46.260
<b>Maru-chan !!</b>

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:46.060
<i>Legendary child actor Maru-chan, now in 
high school, shows off his legendary dance!</i>

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.320
<i>After soundly defeating 
young actor Abe Mitsuru,</i>

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:51.470
<i>he confesses his love to Akutami 
Award-winning novelist Kachi Shirokusa?!</i>

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.480
<b></b>views

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.480
<b></b>Comments

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.480
<b>Legendary child actor Maru-chan, now in high school,
 shows off his legendary dance</b>

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.480
#confession

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.480
#legend

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:54.480
Way to go, Sueharu.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:58.200
You're now known as the guy who 
got rejected a million times.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.440
That's not a good thing!

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:03.450
<i>Oh, by the way, that's a big 
topic on talk shows now, too.</i>

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:19.340
<b>T
o
p
i
c</b>

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:19.340
<b>Legendary Child Actor Maru-chan</b>

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:06.850
<i>It's quite a big deal to see how 
the legendary child actor Maru-chan</i>

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.710
<i>looks in high school after he 
disappeared from the scene,</i>

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:12.710
<i>but the way we see it... 
Talk about the joys of adolescence!</i>

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.190
<i>Shida-chan sure is cute.</i>

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:16.870
<i>Think we could get her in the studio?</i>

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:19.330
<i>I want to hear her say "no" to me, too.</i>

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.840
H-Huh?

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:27.600
Tetsuhiko, damn it! This is 
airing all over the country!

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:29.910
What's wrong with that?

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:33.770
Why do you think I was helping 
you behind the scenes?

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.440
You bastard! I thought you were being 
unusually helpful! That was why?!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:41.410
Obviously! Why would I help if 
there was nothing in it for me?!

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:44.050
Thanks for all the tasty ad revenue!

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:47.030
Screw you, you absolute scumbag!

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:52.380
Stupid Haru! I can't even 
walk around outside now!

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:55.110
Su-chan, you'd better take 
responsibility for this.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.830
Sueharu-oniichan!

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.550
Sueharu-oniichan!

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:07.900
H-Hey, isn't that...

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.770
...that actress who's insanely 
popular right now?!

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:14.250
Momosaka Maria from 
<i>The Perfect Little Sister<i>?!</i></i>

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:18.560
Sueharu-oniichan, it's me! It's your Momo!

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.060
Ow...

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:22.690
Momo, you gotta learn to 
take it down a notch.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.950
But I've missed you so much all these years!

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.940
It has been a long time, huh?

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.480
Oh, I've seen your work, though.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:36.680
You were great as the lead in 
<i>The Perfect Little Sister</i>.

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:38.410
Really? I'm so glad!

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.460
Su-chan, who is this?

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:43.630
I think I'd like an explanation, too, Haru.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:49.140
Oh, I saw you two in that video. 
You're the girls from his past.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.350
What?

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:54.520
I mean, you're the girl 
Onii-chan used to like

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:57.050
and the girl who rejected him. Right?

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.620
Don't worry, Sueharu-oniichan!

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:04.550
I'll make you forget all about 
the girls from your past!

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:06.300
Oh, really?

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:09.910
I'm just a girl from your past, am I, Su-chan?

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:13.920
So, Haru, you just throw me away 
when a replacement comes along?

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.000
I see.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:17.670
Sh-She's just someone from my agency!

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:20.720
I was her senpai, so I looked out for her.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.270
Yes, exactly!

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:26.590
He taught me acting and how 
to communicate with co-stars,

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:29.420
and all kinds of... other things, too.

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.770
Other things?

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:33.050
Yes, other things.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.690
But then he suddenly retired...

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:38.530
So when I saw the video, 
I couldn't stop myself.

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:41.730
Okay, Momo, I get it. Now let go of me!

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:44.930
You're popular now! If anyone sees 
you like this, you'll be in trouble!

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:48.290
I don't care as long as it's 
you I'm with, Onii-chan.

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:49.150
After all...

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:53.670
Sueharu-oniichan is my first love.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:55.860
What?!

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:59.320
This morning was pretty crazy, huh, Sueharu?

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:02.790
Crazy doesn't describe it! 
Whose fault do you think that was?!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.940
Yeah, I know.

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.550
That's why I'm treating you to lunch.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.150
Dude, this is good!

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:11.920
Right?

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.340
So good! So good!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.180
How dumb is he?

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.810
After all that, he's letting 
him off the hook for pizza?

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:21.900
<i>I mean, I can't be that mad at Tetsuhiko.</i>

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:25.750
<i>If I decide to return to acting, that 
video would be excellent promotion.</i>

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:30.530
<i>He probably did it hoping 
that it would help me out.</i>

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:31.670
So...

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:35.610
How did you get this pizza, anyway?

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.130
Oh, about that...

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:38.820
That was all me!

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:41.840
Heya!

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:46.750
Ow! What'd you do that for?!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:47.990
Shut up.

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:50.570
Oh, it's nice to meet you, Maru-senpai!

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:51.870
Here's my card.

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:53.250
Oh, thanks.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:57.760
<b>Jack of All Trades</b>

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:57.760
Asagi Rena

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:54.700
"Jack of all trades"?

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:57.750
Yep! I'm Asagi Rena, first-year!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:03.020
Tetsu-senpai calls me "Rena," 
so you can call me that, too!

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:04.640
Okay, Rena...

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.980
What exactly do you do 
as a jack of all trades?

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:11.360
Anything you want, depending on
 how much you pay.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.640
Anything?

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:14.280
So... even se—

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.620
No sexy stuff.

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:19.540
Are there no hopes or dreams in this world?!

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:22.310
Tetsu-senpai, what's the deal with this guy?

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:23.990
He's so funny!

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:25.000
Dumb, isn't he?

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:28.550
Well, I think he's pretty funny as a person,

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:30.430
but to a girl, he's trash.

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:33.150
Oh, you don't have to worry 
about the "sexy stuff" thing.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:35.290
He's all talk. He doesn't have the guts.

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:37.610
So that's why he was hoping 
money would be the answer.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:41.160
Rena, you're straight-up looking 
down on me now, aren't you?

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:42.710
Not at all, Maru-paisen.

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.630
I totally respect you.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:48.060
I've never felt respected 
by being called "paisen"!

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.110
It's true!

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:53.590
I just think it's dumb that 
you're kinda perverted.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:56.530
Yeah, I'm obviously being made fun of here.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:10:00.150
A younger girl with huge boobs looking down 
on me after meeting me for the first time...

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:02.250
Wait, isn't that a good thing?

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:04.810
Don't come asking me for approval, stupid Haru.

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:06.770
That was sexual harassment!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.790
You guys seriously have no mercy...

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:12.050
How do you two know each other, anyway?

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:14.170
We went to the same middle school.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.410
I use her sometimes 'cause 
she's handy to have around,

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:20.830
and she says she thinks you're 
starting to smell like good money.

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:24.670
She insisted on meeting you, so I made 
her pay for introductions with a pizza.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.970
You're incredible.

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:30.330
You got me pizza to apologize, 
but you didn't even pay for it?

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.860
At this point, I'm actually impressed.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.160
Enough praise. You're making me blush.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:37.950
There wasn't one inch of 
praise in that, Scumhiko!

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:42.420
Y'know, if I'm being honest, you guys 
don't seem to get along that well.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:44.420
Why are you friends?

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.130
Huh? Well, because—

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:48.340
S-S-Su-chan!

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:50.340
O-Oh, it's you, Shiro...

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:52.620
Wh-What's up? Everything okay?

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:55.300
Uh... Yeah... The thing is...

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:56.840
H-Hey, look!

00:10:57.100 --> 00:11:00.270
What's this? A new development? 
Kachi-san's approaching him?!

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:01.940
Guilty!

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:05.290
He's guilty for having a childhood 
friend he made a promise to!

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:06.220
It's okay, Goudo!

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:10.240
Maru's an idiot, so he didn't realize 
that childhood friend was Kachi-san!

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:12.010
It's no wonder she hates him now!

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:13.470
Thank goodness he's so stupid!

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:16.700
Shirokusa-san, it's okay.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:17.950
Meiko...

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:20.580
Su-chan!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.540
Y-Yes?

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:24.480
Please go out with me!

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:25.710
Huh?

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.770
Did she just... confess her love to me?

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:29.750
<i>Wait, did she just... confess her love to me?</i>

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:30.770
Seriously?!

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:33.230
She didn't mean "go out with me."

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:36.490
She meant "come with me." 
Right, Shirokusa-san?

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:39.710
H-Huh?! Uh, right, r-r-right! 
I didn't mean...

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:44.550
It seems Shirokusa-san's 
father knows you, Maru-san.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:48.280
Y-Yeah, of all my sponsors, 
he was the nicest to me.

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:53.080
It seems Shirokusa-san's father has been 
wondering about you all these years,

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:56.580
and he has said he'd like to see 
how you're doing in person.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:57.700
Right?

00:11:57.700 --> 00:11:58.940
Th-That's right!

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:02.020
So I was hoping you'd come 
to my house sometime soon.

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:07.200
O-Of course I wouldn't ask you out 
right in the middle of the classroom!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.170
D-Don't get the wrong idea... about that!

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:11.120
Y-Yeah, I guess not.

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:15.540
Kachi, you're a lot more 
useless than I thought.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:21.210
Kai-kun, isn't there something 
you need to apologize to me for?

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.170
Huh?

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:25.480
I mean uploading that video 
without my permission!

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:29.160
But you're barely in it. 
It's not like it's hurting you.

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:31.390
Why should I have to apologize?

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.170
Huh?!

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:36.390
Y-You... I mean... You fiend!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.120
Shiro, don't.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:40.720
I'll be sure to slug Tetsuhiko later.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.700
Cut him some slack for my sake.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.620
S-Su-chan...

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:47.890
W-Well, if you're asking me to,

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:50.120
I guess I can let him off the hook.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:54.090
And now both you and Kachi have forgiven me.

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.870
Guess that leaves Shida-chan...

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:57.620
What about me?

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:00.490
Ah, Shida-san.

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:03.300
What does the girl who 
rejected Su-chan want now?

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:03.840
<b><i>Rejected Him</i></b>

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.290
Okay, listen...

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:08.290
Was something I said mistaken?

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:15.720
Um, I... I mean, uh...

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:20.360
What's wrong, Su-chan?

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:21.880
Are you okay?

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.000
No.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:32.230
Whoa, Paisen went wild.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:33.420
Wow.

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:35.700
I guess even an idiot like him 
couldn't handle the trauma

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:37.900
of being rejected in front 
of the entire school.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.880
Poor Su-chan.

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:52.000
Don't worry.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:54.820
I won't be mean to you like Shida-san was.

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:00.360
I like that expression, Shida-san.

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.200
It befits a homewrecker.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:03.680
Haru...

00:14:03.680 --> 00:14:06.090
Shida-san, you see what's going on.

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:08.860
Could you stay away from 
Su-chan for a while?

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:09.950
B-But...

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:12.650
You're the one who did this to him.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:15.000
Just so you know,

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.160
if you do anything else to hurt
Su-chan, I will get rid of you,

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:23.920
even if I have to use forbidden wisdom that
humans have kept hidden in the darkness.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:45.070
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:45.070
<b>\hEpisode 4: 
Momosaka Maria Strikes</b>

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:45.070
And I win

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.530
Tetsuhiko, how'd it go with the press?

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.800
<i>It's fine. There's no one 
in front of your house.</i>

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.020
Okay.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:04.130
<b>Kai Tetsuhiko</b>

00:14:57.150 --> 00:15:00.980
<i>And things on the web and TV have 
calmed down so much, it's scary.</i>

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:04.120
<i>I have a feeling there's 
something behind that.</i>

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:05.460
Nah, no way.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:08.620
<i>There's no one at Shida-chan's house, either.</i>

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:11.080
<i>I'll stop by and check 
on her anyway, though.</i>

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:13.560
Make sure you tell me how she's doing.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:17.180
She left school really early, 
so I have no idea what's going on.

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.180
<b>Kai Tetsuhiko</b>

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.190
<i>You haven't tried to contact her?</i>

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:23.460
<i>Also, isn't it your job 
to comfort Shida-chan?</i>

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:26.400
<i>Do you hate her after what happened?</i>

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:27.610
No, it's not that.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:31.630
I mean, what Kuro did to me

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:34.430
is what I was trying to do to Shiro.

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:36.070
So I got what I had coming.

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:39.540
It's not about being mad 
or hating her or anything.

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:44.500
<b>Kai Tetsuhiko</b>

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:43.370
Actually, I feel guilty. And... scared.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:44.510
<i>Because she betrayed you?</i>

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.960
I don't think she betrayed me.

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:52.430
What scares me is that I'm too 
dumb to understand how she feels.

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:56.000
I thought I understood her since 
I was closer to her than anyone,

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.290
but I didn't.

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.250
What should I have done?

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.360
You heard him.

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.900
So? What are you gonna do?

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:28.360
Man, I'm hungry.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.140
It's unlocked?

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:35.410
Welcome home, Sueharu-oniichan!

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:42.140
Onii-chan!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.160
Come on!

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.230
Hey!

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.190
Why are you locking and chaining the door?!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:48.660
I know you must be tired, Onii-chan.

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:51.100
Wait, wait, wait! Are you listening?!

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:54.150
Would you like dinner or a bath?

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.580
Or would you like... me?

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:59.580
Oh, yeah, if you're asking me that,
 my answer is obviously y—

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.360
Wait! That's not even right!

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:03.170
Wait just a minute, Momo!

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:07.200
Listen, Momo! There's a lot I'd like 
to say right now, but first...

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:09.290
Where did you get the key to my house?!

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:14.610
Don't try to just laugh it off!

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:17.520
If you're gonna play dumb, 
just leave right now!

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:21.310
Oh, I remember now! 
The key fell from the sky!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:24.520
I guess it came to me because 
I'm such a good person.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:26.200
It's been so long!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.610
I suppose it'd be okay to lend you the key.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:31.750
Oh, my...

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:35.900
Come, now, Onii-chan. Dinner is ready.

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:39.610
I tried my hardest today! 
Let's eat it together!

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:44.280
Momo, you really made this?

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:47.800
Yes! I interrogated your 
mother a long time ago

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:50.740
to find out what foods you liked!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.660
I see. Thanks.

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:07.770
By the way, Momo...

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.720
You're the one who chased off the press

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:12.280
and calmed things down online, aren't you?

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:15.230
Yes, I did what I had to do.

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:16.940
You saved my skin.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:22.170
But what surprises me is that you 
have enough clout to do that now.

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:26.740
Seriously, it's hard to believe that 
little troublemaker got so popular.

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:30.790
Come on, Onii-chan. Just forget 
about those days already.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:32.400
Like I could forget.

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:34.130
You put me through so much.

00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:37.020
It really brings back memories, doesn't it?

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:41.910
I made it this far thanks to you.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:45.370
I really am grateful from 
the bottom of my heart.

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:46.840
Do you realize that?

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:51.360
When you act all sweet like that, 
there's always an ulterior motive.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:55.820
So, I'd like you to tell me why you 
let yourself into my house now.

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:57.950
I wanted to talk to you,

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:01.780
in a place where no one would interrupt.

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:04.740
I later found out why you 
retired from acting.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:08.420
I could have come to see 
you anytime I wanted to,

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:11.490
but I just kept hesitating.

00:19:11.490 --> 00:19:15.330
I wasn't sure if I should, 
and I couldn't find the courage.

00:19:15.810 --> 00:19:18.550
I mean, the way we parted ways...

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:25.810
So I couldn't do it without 
the right trigger.

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:28.000
And that video was the trigger?

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:31.950
When I saw that video, I was so impressed.

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:36.220
You really were the same 
Sueharu-oniichan I always loved.

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:43.170
And it also convinced me that you're 
the only one who can save me.

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:47.190
Save you? Momo, is something 
going on with you?

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.980
Did someone dig up dirt on you 
and make some nasty demands?

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:53.460
President and CEO

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:53.580
President and CEO

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:53.710
President and CEO

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:57.800
President and CEO

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:57.800
President and CEO of 
Hardy Pro... Hardy Shun?

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.090
Hang on a sec.

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:03.190
Wasn't Auntie Nina the 
president of the agency?

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:04.510
When did that change?

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:07.740
Actually, she fell ill last year.

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:12.910
She recovered quickly, but said she 
wanted to enjoy the rest of her life,

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:15.160
so she handed everything 
down to her son, Shun-san,

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:17.880
and now she's traveling the 
world with her husband.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:20.410
Wow, that's so like her.

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:23.250
She was always the type to 
immediately act on every whim.

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:25.620
But as long as she's well, 
I guess we can see her again.

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:28.840
Shun-san saw you in the video and asked me

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:32.690
to talk you into returning to show business.

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:35.330
Of course, I had every intention 
of doing that anyway...

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.420
President and CEO

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.430
Shun-san, huh?

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:39.470
I've never even heard of him.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:41.660
Auntie Nina never mentioned him at all.

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:44.900
I guess he never got along 
well with his parents.

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:46.440
What do you think of him?

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:48.870
He is definitely competent.

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:51.000
What else? How about his personality?

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:55.510
I think it would be best if 
you found out for yourself.

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:57.530
Would you at least meet with him?

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.230
President and CEO

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:00.240
Well...

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:03.130
Huh? There's a second card.

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:06.460
Would you mind giving the second 
one to Kuroha-san for me?

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:09.700
Kuro? Wait, you mean the president...

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:14.410
Yes. He took an interest in Kuroha-san 
after seeing the video, too.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:16.550
He wants both of you to come by together.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.540
President and CEO

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:22.880
Hey, Sueharu!

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:24.630
Why do you have this thing on the door?!

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:26.400
Open up!

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:28.180
Oh, Midori, it's you.

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:30.020
You're as pushy as ever, I see.

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:32.840
You're not in there with a girl, are you?!

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:36.580
I'll release the chain, okay? 
Just let me close it first.

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:41.970
Sueharu! What's taking so long?

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:46.240
Jeez, you should've opened it right away.

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:48.950
Aoi-chan and Akane, too?

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:51.710
Why are all three of you here at this hour?

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:55.450
You know why! Kuro-nee's lost her mind!

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:58.970
Lost her mind? Kuro? What do you mean?

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:02.320
P-Please just listen calmly, Haru-niisan.

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:06.000
Kuro-nee seems to have developed amnesia.

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:10.040
Amnesia?!
